{"results": [{"name": "Allbirds", "entity_id": "78A44C09-E691-42DA-A553-5CDE6EE9B18A", "types": ["urn:entity:brand"], "properties": {"akas": [{"language": "zh", "value": "Allbirds"}, {"language": "en_au", "value": "All Birds"}], "description": "Founded in 2014, this company has become a leader in the sustainable fashion space by prioritizing eco-friendly materials such as merino wool, eucalyptus tree fiber, and sugarcane-based foams. The brand differentiates itself through a commitment to carbon transparency and a minimalist, utility-first design language that appeals to eco-conscious consumers globally. By focusing on everyday comfort and high-quality, ethically sourced products, it has established a significant presence in the direct-to-consumer footwear market. Its business model is built on simplifying the shopping experience while driving innovation in environmentally responsible material science.", "external": {"instagram": {"id": "allbirds"}, "twitter": {"id": "allbirds"}, "wikidata": {"id": "Q30591057"}}, "founded_year": "2014", "image": {"url": "https://images.qloo.com/i/78A44C09-E691-42DA-A553-5CDE6EE9B18A-420x-auto.jpg"}, "short_description": "Allbirds is a global footwear and apparel brand known for comfortable, sustainable shoes made with innovative natural materials.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "es", "value": "Una marca de calzado y ropa reconocida por su compromiso con la sostenibilidad y el uso de materiales naturales y ecológicos en diseños cómodos para el día a día."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Une marque de chaussures et de vêtements connue pour son engagement envers la durabilité et l'utilisation de matériaux naturels et écologiques dans des designs confortables au quotidien."}, {"language": "de", "value": "Eine Schuh- und Bekleidungsmarke, die für ihr Engagement für Nachhaltigkeit und die Verwendung natürlicher, umweltfreundlicher Materialien in komfortablen Alltagskleidung bekannt ist."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A footwear and apparel brand known for its commitment to sustainability and the use of natural, earth-friendly materials in comfortable, everyday designs."}]}, "popularity": 0.9335830889457714, "disambiguation": "", "tags": [{"name": "Footwear", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:fashion:footwear", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Fashion", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:fashion", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Running", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:fashion:footwear:sneaker:running", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Casual", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:fashion:casual", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Sneakers", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:brand:fashion:footwear:sneakers", "type": "urn:tag:genre:brand"}, {"name": "Minimalist", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo:minimalist", "type": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo"}, {"name": "Neutral Tones", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo:neutral_tones", "type": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo"}, {"name": "Textured Materials", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo:textured_materials", "type": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo"}, {"name": "Clean Lines", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo:clean_lines", "type": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo"}, {"name": "Unpretentious", "tag_id": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo:unpretentious", "type": "urn:tag:aesthetic_property:qloo"}, {"name": "Minimalist Living", "tag_id": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo:minimalist_living", "type": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo"}, {"name": "Low-Impact Travel", "tag_id": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo:low_impact_travel", "type": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo"}, {"name": "Harmonious Relationship With Nature", "tag_id": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo:harmonious_relationship_with_nature", "type": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo"}, {"name": "Ethical Consumption", "tag_id": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo:ethical_consumption", "type": "urn:tag:lifestyle:qloo"}, {"name": "Fashion", "tag_id": "urn:tag:brand_subtype:qloo:fashion", "type": "urn:tag:brand_subtype:qloo